== Trivia ==
* A reference to the [http://gatherer.wizards.com/Pages/Card/Details.aspx?multiverseid=1147 card of the same name] from [[wikipedia:Magic: the Gathering|Magic: the Gathering]], a [[wikipedia:collectible card game|collectible card game]] [[Edmund McMillen]] played since his childhood, this is more notable in the artwork of the [https://foursouls.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/b-contract_from_below.png card in Four Souls] where the words written in the contract are word for word identical to the ones written in the original contract from below card.
* Isaac's name is written at the bottom of the contract, implying that he signed the contract.

